<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of German Cup</p>
<p>quarter-finals on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Hamburg 2 (Schopp 39, Cardoso 83) Bochum 1 (Koezle 63).</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Attendance 17,244.</p>
<p>Freiburg 1 (Spanring 63) VfB Stuttgart 1 (Bobic 48) - after</p>
<p>extra time. Halftime 0-0, 90 minutes 1-1. Stuttgart won 4-2 on</p>
<p>penalties. Attendance 22,500.</p>
</text>
